// * WIZARD_PROJECT_IMAGE {7} [SpWi703 - 2703] (Summons 1 Clone of Caster w/same HP & same spells as caster, clone cannot make physical attacks, caster is held for duration, 1R/CL)
// * Detectable Spell
// * Requires Mod Stat.IDS File (WIZARD_MISLEAD)
// * Requires Mod State.IDS File (STATE_NOT_VISIBLE)
IF
  HaveSpell(WIZARD_PROJECT_IMAGE)                                          // and we have the spell
  CheckStatLT(Myself,1,PUPPETTYPE)                                         // and aren't already under the effects of the spell
