// * CLERIC_STRENGTH_OF_STONE {1} [NMSTRSTN]
// * Requires G3's Divine Remix
// * Requires Mod State.IDS File (STATE_NOT_VISIBLE, STATE_OUT_OF_ACTION)
// * ----------------------------------------------------------------
// * CS: 2, TGT: LA, RNG: Touch, AOE: 1 CRE, DUR: 24-102s
// * ----------------------------------------------------------------
// * Increase STR to 15+1d4, +4 = 18/50 (not 19), 3R+1R/L
IF
  HaveSpellRES("NMSTRSTN")                                                 // if I have the spell
  CheckStatLT(LastSeenBy(Myself),17,STR)                                   // and their STR < 17
  OR(2)
     !GlobalTimerNotExpired("gh_SpellCastThisRound","LOCALS")              // and I am ready to cast.
     CheckStatGT(Myself,0,AURACLEANSING)                                   // or I am Aura Cleansed so no wait
