// * [A specific target is any target with a qualified condition, such as being NOT immune to fire]

// * 4: Specific Attacks [from more specific & large aoe to least specific, single target]

// * WIZARD_COMET {9} [SpWi925 - 2925] (Party Friendly, ranged, AOE 30' radius, 10D10 Fire Dmg, No Save, Wing Buffet + Sleep if those in AOE fail save vs death)
