// * WAND_OF_FEAR [WAND02, multiple, party-friendly, fear, save vs spells +2]
IF
  HasItemEquiped("WAND02",Myself)                                          // if I have the Wand
  !GlobalTimerNotExpired("gh_SpellCastThisRound","LOCALS")                 // and I am ready to cast.
